WEBVTT

00:00.867 --> 00:04.387
<b>It's a city of Forngawn, a 
neutral, multiracial nation</b>

00:04.387 --> 00:07.747
<b>composed primarily of humans and beastmen.</b>

00:07.747 --> 00:10.867
<b>Apparently, the city is named Dragontan.</b>

00:10.867 --> 00:15.037
<b>It seems Dragontan is currently 
in a state of high alert.</b>

00:15.607 --> 00:20.127
<b>We confirmed attacks from 
Barbarians like Ogres and Goblins.</b>

00:20.127 --> 00:22.657
<b>If they're under attack,</b>

00:22.657 --> 00:25.417
<b>there's a chance 
they're generating refugees.</b>

00:25.417 --> 00:27.387
<b>Then for our next turn...</b>

00:28.047 --> 00:31.427
<b>We're dispatching diplomats to 
the neutral nation of Forngawn!</b>

00:35.927 --> 00:38.767
<b>You're not human, are you?</b>

00:41.127 --> 00:42.817
<b>Correct.</b>

02:17.447 --> 02:18.997
Please be my friend!

02:25.917 --> 02:29.847
<b><i>There's an aura of darkness so thick 
about them that I can tell from a glance.</i></b>

02:29.847 --> 02:32.067
<b>L-Lady Tonukapoli...</b>

02:32.607 --> 02:35.347
<b>Don't attack them out of panic!</b>

02:35.937 --> 02:37.597
<b><i>This is bad.</i></b>

02:37.597 --> 02:41.647
<b><i>The beastmen's instincts are 
driving my soldiers to fear.</i></b>

02:42.237 --> 02:44.187
<b>Have everyone wait on standby.</b>

02:44.487 --> 02:45.377
<b>As you wish.</b>

02:47.277 --> 02:51.027
<b><i>She's not someone we can beat. Though...</i></b>

02:52.407 --> 02:56.487
<b><i>If this standoff goes on, then 
our soldiers might act rashly.</i></b>

03:00.497 --> 03:02.527
<b>Do you mind if I step in?!</b>

03:02.527 --> 03:03.607
<b>Good afternoon!</b>

03:03.607 --> 03:05.287
<b>My name is Pepe!</b>

03:05.287 --> 03:07.547
<b>Could you tell me your name?!</b>

03:13.887 --> 03:16.637
<b><i>This fool!</i></b>

03:18.807 --> 03:22.357
<b>I'm surprised you would seek an 
audience with our king as well.</b>

03:22.357 --> 03:27.607
<b>We had only just sent a delegation 
to Dragontan ourselves.</b>

03:27.607 --> 03:30.647
<b>So that's why we happened upon each other?</b>

03:30.647 --> 03:33.047
<b>That's right, Atou!</b>

03:33.047 --> 03:36.487
<b>We actually went through many 
adventures on our way here!</b>

03:36.487 --> 03:37.537
<b>Yes.</b>

03:36.487 --> 03:40.567
<b>Of course, they were all resolved 
safely thanks to my actions,</b>

03:38.447 --> 03:39.327
<b>Umm...</b>

03:39.687 --> 03:42.087
<b>I'm so sorry, Lady Atou.</b>

03:40.567 --> 03:44.117
<b>but I told that hill giant 
that suddenly attacked us!</b>

03:42.087 --> 03:44.117
<b>This boy is a fool.</b>

03:44.117 --> 03:48.497
<b>"You scoundrel, daring to invade Forngawn!"</b>

03:45.437 --> 03:48.497
<b>Oh, are you sure about 
leaving your men behind?</b>

03:48.837 --> 03:49.957
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:48.837 --> 03:51.337
<b>"Face my magic!"</b>

03:49.957 --> 03:53.427
<b>This miasma is a bit too 
harsh for our soldiers,</b>

03:51.337 --> 03:53.427
<b>Then I hit it dead-on!</b>

03:53.427 --> 03:55.677
<b>A real solid blow!</b>

03:53.427 --> 03:55.677
<b>so I'll have them wait outside.</b>

03:55.677 --> 03:58.607
<b>That hill giant was so pathetic.</b>

03:56.377 --> 03:57.567
<b><i>Now,</i></b>

03:57.567 --> 04:02.127
<b><i>we're about to meet the king 
this exceptional monster adores.</i></b>

03:58.607 --> 04:00.367
<b>It gave me this dumbfounded look.</b>

04:00.367 --> 04:04.997
<b>Well, anyway, point is, if I wasn't there, 
it would have destroyed Crescent Moon.</b>

04:02.127 --> 04:05.687
<b><i>I wonder what's awaiting us.</i></b>

04:14.457 --> 04:18.077
<b>This is our great and powerful 
king, King Ira Takuto.</b>

04:20.137 --> 04:21.867
<b><i>We're in trouble.</i></b>

04:21.867 --> 04:23.577
<b><i>I can't get a full measure of him.</i></b>

04:23.577 --> 04:26.377
<b><i>It's like he's darkness itself!</i></b>

04:26.777 --> 04:31.127
<b><i>Well, we just had a terrifying
thing move into the neighborhood.</i></b>

04:31.127 --> 04:35.217
<b><i>Who would have thought my choice 
back then would backfire like this.</i></b>

04:35.217 --> 04:36.747
<b>Grass Tendril Magic!</b>

04:46.767 --> 04:49.567
<b>Brave defenders of Forngawn!</b>

04:49.567 --> 04:51.477
<b>You can rest easy now!</b>

04:51.737 --> 04:53.947
<b>Now that I, a Staff Holder, have arrived—</b>

04:53.947 --> 04:56.057
<b>Man, this is awesome!</b>

04:57.317 --> 04:58.687
<b>Oh! Master Pepe!</b>

04:58.687 --> 04:59.517
<b>We're saved!</b>

04:59.517 --> 05:01.447
<b>The shaman is here to save us!</b>

05:01.447 --> 05:04.647
<b>That's right! Praise me more!</b>

05:04.647 --> 05:10.627
<b>Shaman! Shaman! Shaman! Shaman!</b>

05:11.167 --> 05:12.497
<b>Shaman?!</b>

05:19.977 --> 05:21.507
<b>Quagmire Magic!</b>

05:22.727 --> 05:24.457
<b>Grass Tendril Magic!</b>

05:33.447 --> 05:35.097
<b>Hurry up and finish it off!</b>

05:35.097 --> 05:36.237
<b>R-Right!</b>

05:41.507 --> 05:43.217
<b>Look at what happened to you, Pepe!</b>

05:43.217 --> 05:44.787
<b>Granny Tonukapoli...</b>

05:44.787 --> 05:45.757
<b>Ow!</b>

05:46.517 --> 05:49.477
<b>I told you to call me Lady 
Tonukapoli, not Granny!</b>

05:49.477 --> 05:52.287
<b>I'm still a healthy, young 240 years old!</b>

05:52.287 --> 05:54.397
<b>Huh? Really?</b>

05:54.397 --> 05:56.087
<b>What would be the point of lying about that?!</b>

05:56.087 --> 05:57.777
<b>Honestly...</b>

05:57.777 --> 06:00.227
<b>You're the only young Staff Holder!</b>

06:00.227 --> 06:02.927
<b>You should be more aware 
and act like a leader!</b>

06:02.927 --> 06:04.427
<b>I'll try!</b>

06:04.897 --> 06:07.127
<b>Good grief, I'm worried about your future,</b>

06:07.127 --> 06:09.227
<b>and we're about to head 
to the Accursed Lands too.</b>

06:09.227 --> 06:10.387
<b>We are?</b>

06:10.387 --> 06:13.567
<b>You weren't listening to the 
elders earlier, were you?!</b>

06:13.567 --> 06:16.147
<b>They've received signs of the 
apocalypse coming from there,</b>

06:16.147 --> 06:17.817
<b>so they told us to go investigate!</b>

06:17.817 --> 06:20.247
<b>If these Barbarian attacks keep up,</b>

06:20.247 --> 06:22.617
<b>then sooner or later, we're finished.</b>

06:23.107 --> 06:25.457
<b>It's worse for a detached 
city like Dragontan</b>

06:25.457 --> 06:27.447
<b>since we can't send the army there.</b>

06:27.447 --> 06:30.007
<b>We don't know if the cause of these 
attacks is in the Accursed Lands,</b>

06:30.007 --> 06:31.997
<b>so we need to hurry.</b>

06:32.347 --> 06:34.957
<b>Now let's hurry up and 
prepare for our journey!</b>

06:34.957 --> 06:36.887
<b>I see! Take care, then!</b>

06:36.887 --> 06:38.547
<b>You're coming with me too!</b>

06:42.397 --> 06:47.387
<b><i>If I had just ignored the 
elders and left Pepe behind...</i></b>

06:50.187 --> 06:55.177
<b><i>I never would've brought this 
child to such a dangerous place.</i></b>

06:55.857 --> 06:57.167
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

06:57.167 --> 06:58.717
<b>My name is Pepe!</b>

06:58.717 --> 07:01.067
<b>Please be my friend!</b>

07:02.287 --> 07:04.067
<b>Pepe!</b>

07:05.147 --> 07:07.037
<b>F-Friend?!</b>

07:07.577 --> 07:08.857
<b>P-Please forgive him!</b>

07:08.857 --> 07:10.537
<b>Pepe was nervous, so—</b>

07:11.517 --> 07:12.997
<b>Friends...</b>

07:17.047 --> 07:17.967
<b>Sure.</b>

07:17.967 --> 07:19.207
<b>We're friends now.</b>

07:19.207 --> 07:20.377
<b>Let's all get along.</b>

07:20.627 --> 07:21.377
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:21.377 --> 07:22.837
<b>Yay!</b>

07:25.217 --> 07:28.947
<b>Congratulations on making your 
very first friend, King Takuto!</b>

07:28.947 --> 07:30.867
<b>Now, applause!</b>

07:30.867 --> 07:32.897
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:32.897 --> 07:34.747
<b>Man...</b>

07:36.307 --> 07:38.127
<b><i>This...</i></b>

07:38.127 --> 07:40.797
<b><i>is outrageous.</i></b>

07:46.407 --> 07:47.827
<b>Here you go.</b>

07:47.827 --> 07:50.467
<b>Oh, thank you.</b>

07:54.127 --> 07:55.457
<b>This is...</b>

07:55.757 --> 08:00.197
<b>Our nation of Mynoghra prides itself on 
that being the tastiest drink in the world!</b>

08:00.817 --> 08:04.467
<b>I can't believe something so 
sweet exists in this world.</b>

08:04.867 --> 08:09.557
<b>I've never seen such high-quality 
dishware before either.</b>

08:11.397 --> 08:13.517
<b>What kind of drink is this?!</b>

08:13.887 --> 08:15.667
<b>It's apple juice!</b>

08:15.667 --> 08:16.977
<b>Another, please!</b>

08:18.437 --> 08:21.137
<b>This is really, really good!</b>

08:21.727 --> 08:23.787
<b>You have amazing muscles!</b>

08:23.787 --> 08:26.007
<b>You've trained a whole lot, haven't you?!</b>

08:26.007 --> 08:27.517
<b>Huh? Uh...</b>

08:27.517 --> 08:29.087
<b>Oh, watch this!</b>

08:29.087 --> 08:30.907
<b>My magic is amazing!</b>

08:33.747 --> 08:34.967
<b>Oh?</b>

08:41.867 --> 08:44.687
<b><i>Pepe's social skills are amazing.</i></b>

08:44.687 --> 08:46.927
<b><i>He's already started fitting 
in with everyone.</i></b>

08:47.447 --> 08:49.557
<b><i>I could never pull that off.</i></b>

08:50.347 --> 08:53.207
<b><i>But friends, huh?</i></b>

08:53.207 --> 08:56.707
<b><i>It's my first time having one, 
so I don't know what I should do!</i></b>

08:55.387 --> 09:03.437
<b>Poor Communicator</b>

08:56.707 --> 09:00.357
<b><i>Still, these are also important 
talks with Forngawn.</i></b>

09:00.357 --> 09:03.437
<b><i>I'd like to avoid getting 
drawn into their pace.</i></b>

09:05.127 --> 09:10.897
<b><i>I also need to show friendly intentions 
to prove that we're not hostile.</i></b>

09:11.537 --> 09:12.627
<b><i>All right!</i></b>

09:13.317 --> 09:14.247
<b>Pepe!</b>

09:15.697 --> 09:18.497
<b>W-Want to play a game with me?</b>

09:25.387 --> 09:27.927
<b><i>Everyone's giving me a stilted reaction.</i></b>

09:29.297 --> 09:30.407
<b>That sounds great!</b>

09:30.407 --> 09:31.427
<b>Let's do it!</b>

09:40.977 --> 09:42.367
<b>Here I go!</b>

09:47.907 --> 09:49.487
<b>I win!</b>

09:49.987 --> 09:54.407
<b><i>I've never played a game like 
this before. This feels fresh to me.</i></b>

09:54.407 --> 09:56.577
<b>Let's go another round, Pepe.</b>

09:56.577 --> 09:59.407
<b>Sure thing! Let's play again!</b>

09:59.407 --> 10:01.267
<b>I won't lose this time.</b>

10:07.967 --> 10:10.437
<b>Man, you're a strong opponent!</b>

10:10.437 --> 10:13.677
<b>You picked this up fast 
for a new player, Pepe.</b>

10:13.997 --> 10:15.827
<b>Your apple juice is delicious,</b>

10:15.827 --> 10:18.627
<b>and this game is fun too.</b>

10:18.627 --> 10:21.307
<b>I'm glad I came to Mynoghra!</b>

10:23.187 --> 10:24.367
<b>I know!</b>

10:24.367 --> 10:26.387
<b>Please sell this to our country!</b>

10:26.387 --> 10:28.607
<b>I bet everyone would enjoy it!</b>

10:28.607 --> 10:30.287
<b>Pepe! You can't just—</b>

10:30.287 --> 10:31.157
<b>Sure.</b>

10:32.297 --> 10:34.907
<b><i>We were planning to open trade anyway,</i></b>

10:34.907 --> 10:37.567
<b><i>so I'm glad Pepe brought it up.</i></b>

10:37.567 --> 10:41.067
<b><i>Though there are things I need to 
confirm before ironing out the details.</i></b>

10:42.237 --> 10:45.627
<b><i>It's been very fun playing with a friend.</i></b>

10:46.227 --> 10:49.697
<b><i>But from here, it's time 
for national diplomacy.</i></b>

10:55.677 --> 10:57.497
<b>That's so good!</b>

10:59.167 --> 11:00.157
<b>Ow!</b>

11:00.937 --> 11:03.077
<b>You're getting too relaxed!</b>

11:06.897 --> 11:08.897
<b>By the way, Lady Tonukapoli...</b>

11:08.897 --> 11:11.987
<b>Hmm? What is it, Lady Atou?</b>

11:11.987 --> 11:17.157
<b>I wanted to ask what reason you 
had for coming to our lands.</b>

11:19.687 --> 11:21.957
<b><i>She's brought it up.</i></b>

11:22.807 --> 11:24.537
<b>The truth is, lately,</b>

11:24.817 --> 11:28.547
<b>our country has been repeatedly 
attacked by Barbarians.</b>

11:28.547 --> 11:30.207
<b>That's odd.</b>

11:30.207 --> 11:33.877
<b>Barbarians should generally 
avoid large cities.</b>

11:33.877 --> 11:35.247
<b>That's true.</b>

11:35.247 --> 11:37.927
<b>But they're coming in incredible hordes.</b>

11:37.927 --> 11:42.307
<b>We came here, in part,
to further our investigation.</b>

11:42.307 --> 11:44.477
<b>So you're lacking in military might.</b>

11:46.697 --> 11:48.567
<b><i>Did he uncover that from my attitude?</i></b>

11:48.567 --> 11:49.487
<b><i>This is bad.</i></b>

11:49.487 --> 11:53.357
<b><i>We won't be able to negotiate 
if he knows our weakness.</i></b>

11:53.357 --> 11:56.557
<b>Well, we're able to manage driving them off.</b>

11:56.557 --> 11:59.057
<b>It's just that their behavior is odd.</b>

11:59.057 --> 12:01.327
<b>So better safe than sorry, you know.</b>

12:01.327 --> 12:02.417
<b>That's true.</b>

12:02.417 --> 12:04.917
<b>It sounds a bit too troublesome to ignore.</b>

12:04.917 --> 12:06.037
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:06.037 --> 12:10.617
<b>Well, two of our strongest forces, our Staff 
Holders, have been sent to investigate.</b>

12:10.617 --> 12:13.837
<b>I hope you'll see that as 
a sign of our confidence.</b>

12:13.837 --> 12:16.557
<b>It certainly makes sense.</b>

12:16.557 --> 12:17.387
<b>Huh?</b>

12:19.207 --> 12:20.307
<b>What's wrong?</b>

12:20.687 --> 12:23.437
<b>I thought we were sent to out to investigate</b>

12:23.437 --> 12:26.437
<b>because our country will perish if we 
don't find a way to deal with them.</b>

12:30.267 --> 12:33.487
<b>How could you?!</b>

12:33.867 --> 12:36.697
<b>Did I say something wrong?</b>

12:38.267 --> 12:42.157
<b>Lady Tonukapoli, you have my sympathies.</b>

12:42.157 --> 12:43.347
<b>Hmm?</b>

12:46.557 --> 12:50.337
<b>We have no intention of 
bringing harm to Forngawn.</b>

12:50.657 --> 12:52.877
<b>I'm grateful to hear that, but...</b>

12:52.877 --> 12:56.997
<b>You might suspect that evil beings 
like us are up to something,</b>

12:56.997 --> 13:00.597
<b>but our greatest interest 
is always directed inward.</b>

13:00.597 --> 13:01.557
<b>In short...</b>

13:01.557 --> 13:04.427
<b>Nothing beats peace!</b>

13:04.427 --> 13:05.537
<b>Yes.</b>

13:05.537 --> 13:08.957
<b>Mynoghra is an evil nation that loves peace!</b>

13:10.177 --> 13:12.107
<b>I see.</b>

13:12.487 --> 13:14.987
<b>As for your Barbarians...</b>

13:15.067 --> 13:19.197
<b>Dragontan</b>

13:15.067 --> 13:19.197
<b>Mynoghra</b>

13:15.447 --> 13:18.767
<b>If Dragontan falls, then we're next.</b>

13:19.587 --> 13:21.947
<b>So this matter concerns us too.</b>

13:21.947 --> 13:25.207
<b>Are you willing to help us then?</b>

13:26.167 --> 13:29.407
<b><i>We went to great effort to build 
that city for the Dragon Vein Mine.</i></b>

13:29.407 --> 13:32.167
<b><i>We would certainly appreciate the help, but...</i></b>

13:32.607 --> 13:35.227
<b>What do you think, my king?</b>

13:35.227 --> 13:37.297
<b>Friends should help each other.</b>

13:37.297 --> 13:39.607
<b>I knew you'd get it, Takuto!</b>

13:39.607 --> 13:42.817
<b>So, what do you desire in return?</b>

13:42.817 --> 13:47.517
<b>Thanks to this fool's slip, you could 
take advantage of us as much as you wanted.</b>

13:47.867 --> 13:49.977
<b>The Dragon Vein mine then.</b>

13:53.827 --> 13:57.197
<b>So you saw through it all 
from the start, then?</b>

13:57.597 --> 14:00.137
<b>We're perfectly happy 
with joint control of it.</b>

14:00.137 --> 14:04.457
<b>It's not like we need such a 
vast supply of Mana at present.</b>

14:04.457 --> 14:08.327
<b>Though we would like the right to designate 
which element it's converted to.</b>

14:09.477 --> 14:13.447
<b>You want to convert the Dragon Vein 
Mine's pure Mana into specific elements?</b>

14:13.447 --> 14:17.277
<b>That's a technology that'll take 
us ten more years to develop,</b>

14:17.277 --> 14:20.587
<b>but I take it you've already researched it?</b>

14:25.067 --> 14:28.827
<b>King Ira Takuto, Lady Atou.</b>

14:28.827 --> 14:31.377
<b>Pepe's, well, he's a fool.</b>

14:31.377 --> 14:33.607
<b>He's the greatest fool among us!</b>

14:34.487 --> 14:37.727
<b>However, this child is 
still our nation's future.</b>

14:37.727 --> 14:42.697
<b>He'll eventually lead Forngawn as a
representative of the Staff Holders.</b>

14:42.697 --> 14:47.267
<b>Plus, Pepe is the best judge of 
character in all of our nation.</b>

14:47.267 --> 14:48.407
<b>So—</b>

14:48.837 --> 14:51.587
<b>Pepe! You decide!</b>

14:51.587 --> 14:54.127
<b>You have that right as a Staff Holder.</b>

14:55.637 --> 14:57.637
<b>Come on, Granny.</b>

14:57.637 --> 15:00.087
<b>I said it from the beginning, didn't I?</b>

15:00.377 --> 15:09.977
Mynoghra and Forngawn have forged an alliance.

15:00.867 --> 15:04.697
<b>I want us to be friends with 
the people of Mynoghra.</b>

15:14.707 --> 15:21.557
<b>Now, let's reaffirm and discuss the decisions
 made during our latest negotiations.</b>

15:21.557 --> 15:22.407
<b>Emle?</b>

15:22.407 --> 15:23.197
<b>Yes.</b>

15:23.197 --> 15:27.697
<b>We've agreed to export provisions 
and toys to Forngawn.</b>

15:27.787 --> 15:33.207
<b>Mynoghra</b>

15:27.787 --> 15:33.207
<b>Forngawn</b>

15:27.787 --> 15:33.207
<b>Food</b>

15:27.787 --> 15:33.207
<b>Metal Goods, Daily Necessities, 
and Other Consumables</b>

15:27.787 --> 15:33.207
<b>Support Defeating the Barbarians
 Attacking Dragontan</b>

15:27.787 --> 15:33.207
<b>Joint Control of the
 Dragon Vein Mine</b>

15:28.107 --> 15:33.207
<b>In return, we'll be importing 
daily necessities and metal goods.</b>

15:33.207 --> 15:39.377
<b>It will be a relief to have those since 
we've been relying on our king for them.</b>

15:39.377 --> 15:44.967
<b>Yes. Also, our biggest gain is obtaining 
access to the Dragon Vein Mine.</b>

15:45.527 --> 15:48.427
<b>Sir Pepe's slip was most fortuitous.</b>

15:48.427 --> 15:51.347
<b>Though his rashness is slightly concerning.</b>

15:51.617 --> 15:53.057
<b>That's true.</b>

15:53.517 --> 15:56.307
<b><i>Though if it weren't for Pepe...</i></b>

15:57.037 --> 16:00.727
<b><i>Then our talks would have probably 
ended in much more innocuous terms.</i></b>

16:00.727 --> 16:05.927
<b><i>Something as tepid as "Let's take our 
time learning about each other."</i></b>

16:06.957 --> 16:11.507
<b><i>If that was the outcome, we wouldn't 
be able to aid Dragontan in time.</i></b>

16:11.507 --> 16:14.527
<b><i>But what if he said that because 
he was thinking that far ahead?</i></b>

16:16.537 --> 16:17.937
<b>King Takuto?</b>

16:20.657 --> 16:22.617
<b>Let's set Pepe aside for now.</b>

16:22.617 --> 16:24.327
<b>I think he'll be fine.</b>

16:24.327 --> 16:25.337
<b>Yes.</b>

16:25.337 --> 16:27.467
<b>Then getting back on track,</b>

16:27.467 --> 16:31.127
<b>let's decide our policy on 
future relations with Forngawn.</b>

16:31.127 --> 16:32.097
<b>Umm?</b>

16:32.097 --> 16:34.567
<b>Yes? Feel free to speak your mind.</b>

16:35.057 --> 16:38.627
<b>What kind of country is 
Forngawn in the first place?</b>

16:38.627 --> 16:39.767
<b>We don't know.</b>

16:41.227 --> 16:42.607
<b><i>Thank you!</i></b>

16:42.607 --> 16:45.357
<b>Yes, good question, indeed.</b>

16:45.357 --> 16:48.167
<b>In order to develop international relations,</b>

16:48.167 --> 16:54.077
<b>we need to learn more details 
about their values and customs.</b>

16:54.077 --> 16:55.767
<b><i>That's a blind spot for me,</i></b>

16:55.767 --> 16:59.127
<b><i>since the game never concerned 
itself with those details.</i></b>

16:59.127 --> 17:03.447
<b>In that case, we'll need to 
investigate Forngawn first.</b>

17:03.447 --> 17:04.587
<b>However...</b>

17:04.587 --> 17:16.637
<b>Forngawn</b>

17:04.587 --> 17:16.637
<b>Dragontan</b>

17:04.587 --> 17:16.637
<b>Mynoghra</b>

17:05.167 --> 17:08.637
<b>Forngawn's capital, Crescent 
Moon, is very far away,</b>

17:08.637 --> 17:10.787
<b>so it'll take time to investigate.</b>

17:10.787 --> 17:12.657
<b>Let's put that on hold for now.</b>

17:12.657 --> 17:15.537
<b>We should prioritize Dragontan, 
since it needs the aid.</b>

17:15.537 --> 17:16.637
<b>Understood.</b>

17:17.057 --> 17:23.607
<b>However, we'll need some kind of formal 
reason to head directly into another nation.</b>

17:24.167 --> 17:25.607
<b>We're going there to play!</b>

17:28.917 --> 17:30.577
<b>Uh...</b>

17:30.847 --> 17:33.367
<b>That's what Pepe said, right?</b>

17:33.367 --> 17:34.867
<b>That's right!</b>

17:34.867 --> 17:39.957
<b>We can quickly send out a few people to pay our 
respects before sending a formal delegation.</b>

17:40.407 --> 17:42.467
<b>In that case,</b>

17:42.467 --> 17:43.847
<b>then may I humbly ask,</b>

17:43.847 --> 17:46.727
<b>should I head there myself?</b>

17:46.727 --> 17:51.097
<b>Hmm, I think you're too important 
for that to work, Moltar.</b>

17:51.457 --> 17:53.387
<b>Oh, right.</b>

17:53.387 --> 17:56.877
<b>He may just be a wise old man to us,</b>

17:56.877 --> 17:59.847
<b>but other nations would see him as 
the Chancellor and Minister of Magic.</b>

18:00.827 --> 18:03.717
<b>There were some unnecessary 
comments there, but you're right.</b>

18:03.717 --> 18:05.607
<b>In that same vein, Gia would be our General,</b>

18:05.607 --> 18:07.387
<b>and Emle our Minister of Domestic Affairs.</b>

18:07.387 --> 18:09.857
<b>All of us would be too important 
for a simple show of respect.</b>

18:09.857 --> 18:11.617
<b>We need someone with appropriate status,</b>

18:11.617 --> 18:12.707
<b>who we can trust,</b>

18:12.707 --> 18:14.737
<b>and who doesn't hold an official post.</b>

18:15.737 --> 18:17.207
<b>We'll do our best!</b>

18:18.247 --> 18:19.287
<b>Isn't that dangerous?!</b>

18:19.677 --> 18:21.497
<b>They're both candidates for leadership.</b>

18:21.497 --> 18:23.877
<b>That's neither too little 
nor too great status.</b>

18:23.877 --> 18:27.407
<b>I also believe they would be the perfect 
fit so they can gain experience from this.</b>

18:26.667 --> 18:28.547
<b>"If you love them, let them see the world" mindset</b>

18:28.547 --> 18:30.047
<b>But isn't that dangerous?!</b>

18:30.047 --> 18:31.257
<b>Protective mindset</b>

18:31.757 --> 18:33.267
<b>I'll go!</b>

18:33.267 --> 18:37.307
<b>Our king is worried about what might happen 
to them if they were to be kidnapped!</b>

18:37.307 --> 18:38.557
<b>Overprotective of the King mindset</b>

18:38.557 --> 18:42.377
<b>Lady Atou, you are our king's 
most trusted confidant.</b>

18:42.377 --> 18:44.317
<b>It would be an even bigger deal if you went.</b>

18:45.397 --> 18:51.407
<b>Trusted Confidant</b>

18:45.747 --> 18:47.037
<b>Trusted confidant...</b>

18:47.957 --> 18:51.407
<b>Yes, his most trusted confidant 
couldn't possibly go!</b>

18:53.057 --> 18:54.107
<b>My king.</b>

18:54.617 --> 18:58.277
<b>My king, you told us before, right?</b>

18:58.277 --> 19:00.397
<b>That we're free.</b>

19:00.397 --> 19:01.447
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:01.447 --> 19:03.437
<b>We want to prove useful to you.</b>

19:03.437 --> 19:06.547
<b>That's one thing we wish 
for with our freedom.</b>

19:06.547 --> 19:08.597
<b>But what if something happens to you?</b>

19:07.817 --> 19:09.337
<b>We're willing to take that risk.</b>

19:13.797 --> 19:16.307
<b>My king, please.</b>

19:23.917 --> 19:26.187
<b>Please, my king!</b>

19:32.547 --> 19:33.567
<b>Fine.</b>

19:33.567 --> 19:35.447
<b>Yay!</b>

19:35.577 --> 19:40.787
<b>M-My king just caved in to the 
pestering of someone other than me?!</b>

19:40.787 --> 19:42.207
<b>Still, my king,</b>

19:42.207 --> 19:43.997
<b>sending those two by themselves isn't...</b>

19:44.277 --> 19:46.887
<b>Yeah, no need to worry about that.</b>

19:46.887 --> 19:49.427
<b>I have something in mind for their guards.</b>

19:55.977 --> 19:57.247
<b>Hmph!</b>

19:57.757 --> 20:00.017
<b>I-It's not what you think, Atou.</b>

20:00.017 --> 20:02.347
<b>I didn't just cave in to their begging...</b>

20:02.347 --> 20:03.867
<b>Hmph!</b>

20:03.867 --> 20:08.727
<b>You can just abandon me and go on 
ahead with building your harem!</b>

20:10.517 --> 20:11.447
<b>My king!</b>

20:11.447 --> 20:12.197
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:18.917 --> 20:21.607
<b>You should just tell her 
what you're thinking.</b>

20:27.927 --> 20:29.967
<b>Uh, Atou...</b>

20:30.847 --> 20:33.967
<b>Well, thank you.</b>

20:33.967 --> 20:36.467
<b>For thinking about me all the time.</b>

20:39.657 --> 20:43.207
<b>I really am sorry about recent events.</b>

20:43.207 --> 20:46.097
<b>I didn't mean to make 
you worry so much, Atou.</b>

20:46.097 --> 20:47.847
<b>I never would have made it this far</b>

20:47.847 --> 20:50.487
<b>if I didn't have you at my side.</b>

20:50.487 --> 20:51.977
<b>Oh, it's nothing.</b>

20:51.977 --> 20:54.317
<b>I need you.</b>

20:54.317 --> 20:57.617
<b>Please cheer up, Atou.</b>

21:00.557 --> 21:02.907
<b>You're the only one for me, Atou.</b>

21:09.607 --> 21:12.197
<b>You're the only one for me, Atou.</b>

21:20.277 --> 21:21.977
<b>Thank you!</b>

21:31.397 --> 21:35.587
<b>Y-Yes, King Takuto...</b>

21:41.027 --> 21:42.727
<b>This is our Clinic.</b>

21:42.727 --> 21:44.367
<b>Where diseases are cured!</b>

21:44.837 --> 21:46.077
<b>Correct!</b>

21:46.077 --> 21:47.677
<b>The Building Cost is low too,</b>

21:47.677 --> 21:49.077
<b>so I had it built.</b>

21:49.077 --> 21:51.327
<b>My king, are you sick?</b>

21:51.327 --> 21:52.587
<b>I'm not.</b>

21:52.587 --> 21:55.007
<b>We're here because your guard is here.</b>

21:55.897 --> 21:58.467
<b>You don't mean <i>them</i>, do you?</b>

21:58.757 --> 22:00.587
<b>Yeah, <i>them</i>!</b>

22:02.727 --> 22:06.107
<b>The unit I just produced a little while ago!</b>
